[h2]Toxeus the Murderer, Enslaver of Souls now wears his demons black shadow shroud[/h2]
[list]
[*]The shadow marauders he summons have always smoked constantly, even standing still, because that shroud is built into their model rather than set on the monster. The Enslaver himself had two lesser versions instead: one that only played while he was RUNNING, and he is a caster who stands, and one that only switched on once a fight had started. Both of them came off his hands rather than from around him.
[*]He now carries the marauders own effect, hung at the same point on his skeleton that their model hangs it on, and it is ON out of combat, so he wears it while he stands. Every summoned tier of him wears it too.
[*]The shared creature AI records that drive his shroud were NOT edited: he and his tiers moved onto their own copies, so the 148 other pets and the other bosses that ride those same records are untouched.
[/list]

[i]Visual only. No stats, no damage, no drop rates and no map changes in this update.[/i]

